148	   * Acquire read lock on resource.
149	   *
150	   * For S3_BUCKET_LOCK, VOLUME_LOCK, BUCKET_LOCK type resource, same
151	   * thread acquiring lock again is allowed.
152	   *
153	   * For USER_LOCK, PREFIX_LOCK, S3_SECRET_LOCK type resource, same thread
154	   * acquiring lock again is not allowed.
155	   *
156	   * Special Note for USER_LOCK: Single thread can acquire single user lock/
